  "abstract": "Turns the OWASP Top 10 for LLM Applications into a review workflow for LLM-powered applications. It covers three version lines: the 2026 edition (Version 2026, 3 August 2026) as current, the 2025 edition (18 November 2024) as supported, and v1.1 (16 October 2023) as legacy; no preview is published. SKILL.md holds the invariants and the review workflow; references cover the version lines with an ID table across editions and upgrade steps, the ten 2026 entries in two files with their numbered mitigations, and a checklist grouped by prompts, input, tools, output, data, retrieval, supply chain and consumption, with the Appendix A mappings to the Agentic Top 10 and MITRE ATLAS.",
